cursor 1 1 hidden
== text
 ⚡ schway  ~/demo on main

  Turn 1 details

  Attempt 1: interactive · /home/test/demo · started 2026-01-15 09:26 UTC · ✓█
  Done · 3m 20s
    Git snapshots captured before and after the attempt
    Model: 4 calls · 1m 58s · first output 4.7s–31s · no retries
    Tools: 3 timed calls · 1m 21s wall time
    Tokens: input 160,000 · cached input 129,600 · output 6,000 · reasoning
  4,800
    Reasoning: no level sent; the provider's default applied · xai/grok-4.7
  via Grok subscription
  3 tool results; 0 failed tools.
  Commands: 3 exited 0, 0 nonzero, 0 without an observed exit.
  Token counts are what the provider reported, not billing. Cached input is
  part of input and reasoning is part of output.
  Model time adds every model attempt, including failed ones. Tool time is
  wall time with at least one tool running, so parallel tools count once;
  approval waits are part of it.
  Command times exclude approval waits. No first output means no text or
  thinking arrived before the call completed.
  A backoff cut short by a stop counts as waited time, not a retry. A call


